From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Euiseo Cha <escha@zeroday0619.dev>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 15:14:14 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ssh): enable portable TERM forwarding by default

The tip tag already keeps local sessions on xterm-ghostty and routes integrated shell wrappers through ghostty +ssh. However, both SSH integration features are disabled by default, so ordinary ssh commands bypass the portable TERM selection.

Enable ssh-env by default. Loaded shell integrations now invoke ghostty +ssh with terminfo disabled unless explicitly requested, causing ordinary remote sessions to use xterm-256color while local sessions retain xterm-ghostty. Add a regression test for the default feature environment.

Validation:
- Passed zig fmt --check for the modified Zig files.
- Passed zig build test -Dtest-filter=setup features with Zig 0.16.0.
- Passed git diff --check.
- Live remote SSH requires verification.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-daybreak-blue-latest

diff --git a/src/config/Config.zig b/src/config/Config.zig
index bf4e75f..b614e18 100644
--- a/src/config/Config.zig
+++ b/src/config/Config.zig
@@ -2964,6 +2964,8 @@ keybind: Keybinds = .{},
 ///     remote hosts and propagates COLORTERM, TERM_PROGRAM, and TERM_PROGRAM_VERSION.
 ///     Whether or not these variables will be accepted by the remote host(s) will
 ///     depend on whether or not the variables are allowed in their sshd_config.
+///     This feature is enabled by default so integrated SSH sessions use
+///     `xterm-256color` without requiring Ghostty's terminfo entry remotely.
 ///     (Available since: 1.2.0)
 ///
 ///   * `ssh-terminfo` - Enable automatic terminfo installation on remote hosts.
@@ -8825,7 +8827,7 @@ pub const ShellIntegrationFeatures = packed struct {
     cursor: bool = true,
     sudo: bool = false,
     title: bool = true,
-    @"ssh-env": bool = false,
+    @"ssh-env": bool = true,
     @"ssh-terminfo": bool = false,
     path: bool = true,
 };
diff --git a/src/termio/shell_integration.zig b/src/termio/shell_integration.zig
index d56a84c..4fe7570 100644
--- a/src/termio/shell_integration.zig
+++ b/src/termio/shell_integration.zig
@@ -243,6 +243,15 @@ test "setup features" {
     defer arena.deinit();
     const alloc = arena.allocator();
 
+    // The default features enable portable SSH TERM forwarding.
+    {
+        var env = EnvMap.init(alloc);
+        defer env.deinit();
+
+        try setupFeatures(&env, .{}, true);
+        try testing.expectEqualStrings("cursor:blink,path,ssh-env,title", env.get("GHOSTTY_SHELL_FEATURES").?);
+    }
+
     // Test: all features enabled
     {
         var env = EnvMap.init(alloc);
